# ——— generated by `npm run gen` ————————————————————
# Derived from scripts/source-images/ (which IS committed) and CMS/*/images/,
# so these are reproducible and would only ever churn the diff. Run
# `npm run gen` after a fresh clone, before `npm run build`.
public/images/archive/
public/og.png
public/favicon.svg
public/apple-touch-icon.png
public/icon-192.png
public/icon-512.png

# ——— NOT PUBLISHABLE ————————————————————————————
# github.com/fogca/pyrenees is a PUBLIC repo.
#
# Temporary mood/reference photography (other brands' work, pulled in as a
# stand-in look). Fine to publish on the pre-launch preview, NOT ours to
# redistribute in a public repo. Delete the folder to fall back to the
# studio's own frames in scripts/source-images/.
scripts/placeholder-photos/
# ...and a couple of them dropped into a project folder as a stand-in hero.
# Same reason: not ours to republish. Delete the file to fall back.
CMS/**/*_wine.jpg

# Unica 77 LL — Lineto WEB TRIAL. Internal/dev evaluation only, explicitly not
# cleared for a public production domain, so committing it here would be
# redistribution. The file stays on disk and in the Cloudflare deploy; it is
# simply not in git. Buy the licence, then delete this line and commit the
# production cut.
public/fonts/*.woff2
